  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Human rights protection in the context of the &quot;Total Peace&quot; in Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project aims at protecting the human rights of victims of the armed conflict and human rights defenders in Colombia, through capacity-building, communication, advocacy, and provision of legal representation to victims. The project sets out to support women human rights defenders, leaders, and victims to demand their rights and gain visibility.
  
The project will be implemented at the national level in Bogot&#xE1; with a regional focus on Antioquia, Caquet&#xE1;, Cauca, Cundinamarca, C&#xF3;rdoba, Nari&#xF1;o, Nari&#xF1;o, Putumayo, and Valle del Cauca. Advocacy actions will be carried out at the United Nations Human Rights Council in Geneve and representation of cases in the Inter American Human Rights Court.</narrative>
  </description>
